note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 5 fresh, lines 125-126: elements 0..6 written (unroll 7), element 7 not; a get with a
note non-constant index is error 27 unless all N bits are definitely written.
om2
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh k ulong to ulong
for i ulong 7 unroll
put s i 1
end
ret ulong get s k
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
putd f a 3
ret 0
end
